548892559458346_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0t3mqib7F1AQ7kNvwEwXZA9&_nc_oc=AdrZLHpwWy6VP_OJ1QgeDZ61MSvKMKaUxxaQQFh96ypT3VSYG6dUSHLhMjocy3B7V54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3hM4Lplk3aLtRU5UW9N7eoK3y_UB5Oymlq5wNDHh70nA&oe=69ECA382"}, {"file_name": "THE-BOYS_SCREENSHOTS_2560x1440_SCR04_V3.png", "id": "2788107554875605", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_2788107558208938_7299066219949517619_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i-MAJv_pWfYQ7kNvwGPeXTS&_nc_oc=AdrK6scssGLu9RGqBalEVi3P77SK04NY97UCoQ3VQSf4nxjbXwN_xyFiyixYsn_SX8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3yFnMJFr7jMKmBTTbR6yXFVAauBKwZQQ2_v6m2iCCGTg&oe=69ECBFA5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The-Boys-Trigger-Warning-Landscape.png", "id": "891554670215485", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296069_891554673548818_6200755733166807755_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qDUcMiOHgH8Q7kNvwEKLEon&_nc_oc=Adpv5HEzIQ3UuPCcOX5USvJBpsT-JeDAyhnTgxA7Wq29jV-1pToQv7xWtzp4uua2OSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3FxqEM5sgON15_j6DXqIsmjEI_rTESsXDzghAmuiEJ1Q&oe=69ECD600"}, "display_name": "The Boys", "keywords": ["superhero", "shooter", "rpg", "combat", "fight"], "long_description": "Developed with the creators and featuring cast from the hit series, \u201cThe Boys: Trigger Warning\u201d plunges you into the gloriously twisted world of The Boys. This time, you\u2019re not watching the chaos\u2014you\u2019re in it: close-up, personal, and dangerously real.\n\nLucas Costa\u2019s life detonates when the Armstrongs\u2014a washed-up but still lethal family of Vought Superheroes\u2014turn a family outing into carnage. The Boys drag Lucas back from the brink, juice him with powers, and throw him headfirst into their filthy underground war against Vought and its Supes. With Butcher and Mother\u2019s Milk guiding from the shadows, Lucas sets off on a no-mercy hunt to put the Armstrongs in the ground.\n\n**Become a Supe\u2026Whether You Bloody Want To or Not**\n\nUnstable powers. Impossible decisions. Zero oversight.\n\n**Stealth or Chaos**\n\nPlan it out or blow it up. Either way, it\u2019s ugly. \n\n**Reach, Grab, Break**\n\nPull, crush and fling enemies using telekinesis.\n\n**Temp V: Temporary powers, permanent consequences**\n\nBreak out hand blades, vanish in heavy-duty camouflage, or go full Homelander with laser eyes.\n\n**Vought: The Bright Lights and What\u2019s Beneath**\n\nTour Vought\u2019s sprawling corporate machine, from The Seven\u2019s pristine 99th floor to the bowels of Voughtland. And facilities that don\u2019t exist (per Vought legal).\n\n**Brutal Boss Fights**\n\nKnockdown, Drag-Out Carnage.\n\n**Familiar Faces, Unwelcome Surprises**\n\nButcher, M.M., Kimiko, Ashley, Homelander\u2026 and a different kind of Soldier Boy.\n\n**Real Voices**\n\nLaz Alonso, Jensen Ackles, Colby Minifie, and P.J. Byrne are back!", "short_description": "Developed with the creators and featuring cast from the hit series, \u201cThe Boys: Trigger Warning\u201d plunges you into the gloriously twisted world of The Boys.\nLucas Costa\u2019s life detonates when the Armstrongs\u2014a washed-up but still lethal family of Vought Superheroes\u2014turn a family outing into carnage. The Boys drag Lucas back from the brink, juice him with powers, and throw him headfirst into their filthy underground war against Vought and its Supes."}]}, "developer_name": "ARVORE IMMERSIVE GAMES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://arvore.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sony Pictures Virtual Reality (SPVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://arvore.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con